Kino plugin "Pelispedia". Site behaviour (the listing pages, a title's page, the season request and the player option pages) was read from the live
site and from the CloudStream provider "PelispediaProvider" in redblacker8/storm-ext (a fork of Stormunblessed/storm-ext); no code was copied from it.
The extractors, the packer reader and the request helper are adapted from the Kino plugin "Latino" (xuper-plugin/kino-plugin-latino, Apache-2.0), by
the same author.
